                <invention-title lang="en">NANOPORE/NANOWELL ELECTRODE ENABLED EXONUCLEASE SEQUENCING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a device, comprising a substrate comprising a chamber, the chamber comprising a proximal opening, a distal opening, sidewalls and an interior volume, wherein the interior volume of the chamber is a confined volume; a first seal over the proximal opening of the chamber and a second seal over the distal opening of the chamber, wherein the second seal can conduct ions and cannot transport a polymer or monomeric unit of the polymer; a transmembrane channel in the first seal; and a component configured to detect an interaction between a molecule and the transmembrane channel.</p>
